{"id":"dema_s","lemma":"demás","pos":"pron","rank":458,"glosses":["others, other ones"],"ipa":"/deˈmas/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Wikipedian-walker-dem%C3%A1s.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Dónde están todos los demás?","en":"Where's everyone else?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461883","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Mi madre no es como las demás.","en":"My mother isn't like other mothers.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/518297","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"mother"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Él a menudo ayuda a los demás.","en":"He often helps others.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453490","words":[{"g":"he"},null,null,{"g":"help, aid"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"often, oftentimes"]]},{"text":"Nunca hables mal de los demás.","en":"Never speak ill of others.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/590264","words":[{"g":"never"},{"g":"to talk","l":"hablar"},{"g":"badly, poorly, ill"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Él estaba dispuesto a ayudar a los demás.","en":"He was willing to help others.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/616336","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"willing"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to help"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},null]}]}